'''Sandy''' is a [[Common Weapons|common]] knife that is obtainable by unboxing it from [[Knife Box 5]] or through trading. It cannot be salvaged.
== Appearance ==
It’s blade is pale brown in color and uses a layered sand texture, hence the name. The guard is gold, and the handle is solid black. 
